[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11941.429, "timestamp": "03:19:01", "text": "我没看到其他人这样做。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11944.309, "timestamp": "03:19:04", "text": "是啊，因为她几乎每天都直播。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11946.229, "timestamp": "03:19:06", "text": "我的天啊，拉肯怎么了？她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11949.349, "timestamp": "03:19:09", "text": "像往常一样直播。她呃呃说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11952.79, "timestamp": "03:19:12", "text": "因为她喜欢，所以才写了当天的日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11954.63, "timestamp": "03:19:14", "text": "一天下来，她大概会有两个宝宝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11956.469, "timestamp": "03:19:16", "text": "片段和其他东西。确实如此。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11959.59, "timestamp": "03:19:19", "text": "一条流，但有两个部分，且 1"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11962.55, "timestamp": "03:19:22", "text": "玩一个游戏或什么东西要花一两个小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11964.71, "timestamp": "03:19:24", "text": "剩下的就留作他用了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11967.269, "timestamp": "03:19:27", "text": "就是这样。我的意思是，我可以那样做，但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11970.63, "timestamp": "03:19:30", "text": "YouTube 不行，但在 Twitch 上我可以。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11973.349, "timestamp": "03:19:33", "text": "他喜欢对东西进行分类，也喜欢制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11976.87, "timestamp": "03:19:36", "text": "稍后添加章节和时间戳。但是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11979.59, "timestamp": "03:19:39", "text": "对，YouTube，那可就糟了。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11983.349, "timestamp": "03:19:43", "text": "可以那样做，但会很痛苦。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11986.71, "timestamp": "03:19:46", "text": "是的。你好。所以，我希望这能帮到我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11989.429, "timestamp": "03:19:49", "text": "多做一些类似的，这将是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11992.79, "timestamp": "03:19:52", "text": "练习制作和练习如何制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11995.83, "timestamp": "03:19:55", "text": "制作视频之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11998.15, "timestamp": "03:19:58", "text": "是的，因为我想我已经提过了。"}]